6.2 SYSTEM OVERVIEW
The Ai Mock Interviewer is an AI-powered web-based application designed to simulate real-world interview experiences. The system generates customized interview questions using Large Language Models (LLaMA, Mixtral) via the Groq API, evaluates user responses in real-time, and provides structured feedback to help users improve their interview skills.
The system is intended for students, job seekers, and professionals seeking to enhance their interview preparation through an interactive, intelligent, and scalable platform.
6.3 SYSTEM PURPOSE AND SCOPE
6.3.1 Purpose
The purpose of the Ai Mock Interviewer system is to provide an automated, AI-driven mock interview platform that:
•	Simulates real-world interview conditions.
•	Generates dynamic, role-specific interview questions.
•	Evaluates user responses using natural language processing.
•	Provides immediate, actionable feedback.
•	Tracks user performance over time through analytics.
6.3.2 Scope
The system supports:
•	Technical and behavioral interview preparation.
•	Multiple difficulty levels (Easy, Medium, Hard).
•	Role-based question generation (e.g., Software Engineer, Data Analyst, Web Developer).
•	Real-time AI-based feedback generation.
•	User performance monitoring and analytics.
Out of Scope:
•	Voice-based interaction and speech recognition.
•	Video-based facial or behavioral analysis.
•	Integration with external recruitment platforms.
